NickelRotate (experimental)

Clara BW and Clara Colour, firmware 4.45 and newer within 4.x.
Firmware 5.x is excluded.
Open a book, open its reading menu, and choose Portrait or Landscape.
Auto rotation is unavailable. Home, Library and general settings stay portrait.
The selected reading orientation uses Kobo's existing saved preference.

Clara BW N365 and P365 and Clara Colour N367 are enabled.
P365 has not been tested on a device.
Rotation, touch and the popup fixes are confirmed on Clara BW N365 with
0.1.8-dev and firmware 4.45.23697. Rotation and touch are also confirmed
on Clara Colour N367 with 0.1.7-dev and firmware 4.45.23697.
Broader hardware and firmware validation remains incomplete.
Temporary touch tracing has been removed.
Old diagnostics and observe-touch markers are ignored.

To disable the mod, create an empty disabled file and reboot.
To remove the mod, delete uninstall and reboot.
NickelHook's startup failsafe does not cover touch problems found later.

